        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, primal)\n\nThe mukradi breathes a blast of energy from one of its three heads; each creature in the area must attempt a 36 basic Reflex save. The mukradi can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Acid Maw** (acid) 10-foot-wide, 60-foot line of acid dealing 16d6 acid damage.\n- **Flame Maw** (fire) 60-foot cone of fire dealing 16d6 fire damage.\n- **Shock Maw** (electricity) 120-foot line of electricity dealing 16d6 electricity damage."
            },
